[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13682.87, "timestamp": "03:48:02", "text": "然后我碰巧看到好像有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13684.55, "timestamp": "03:48:04", "text": "这位观众是位狂热粉丝或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13687.11, "timestamp": "03:48:07", "text": "某物。那是很久以前的事了。我问"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13691.429, "timestamp": "03:48:11", "text": "他们就像在问：“你能告诉我这是什么吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13694.55, "timestamp": "03:48:14", "text": "东西。我把我的事和我的担忧告诉了他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13696.469, "timestamp": "03:48:16", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。我讨厌人们这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13700.07, "timestamp": "03:48:20", "text": "评判这个那个。他告诉我呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13703.349, "timestamp": "03:48:23", "text": "关于所有这些不同类型的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13707.59, "timestamp": "03:48:27", "text": "现在很多粉丝都像我一样，什么粉丝男孩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13711.429, "timestamp": "03:48:31", "text": "分类是否正确？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13714.07, "timestamp": "03:48:34", "text": "那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13717.11, "timestamp": "03:48:37", "text": "而且中间还有很多狂热粉丝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13718.79, "timestamp": "03:48:38", "text": "我发现它们只是因为球体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13723.269, "timestamp": "03:48:43", "text": "什么样的戏剧才算戏剧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13728.15, "timestamp": "03:48:48", "text": "啊，橙子，等等，对，橙子，是的。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.95, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "是的。灵性也是一种拥有……的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13733.67, "timestamp": "03:48:53", "text": "类似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13736.55, "timestamp": "03:48:56", "text": "嗯，就是那个语音合成器，对吧？那不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13738.07, "timestamp": "03:48:58", "text": "这"}]